    "detailed_description": "<strong>An isometric action game</strong>, with frenetic visuals and high difficulty. Absorb attacks, release them on your enemies. Killing or not is your option.<br><br><strong>A killing game where you need to avoid killing</strong>: Use your ammo in a lethal or non-lethal way. Collect kills and get new power-ups and attacks as the story progresses.<br><br><strong>A post-apocalyptic city</strong>, compact buildings, tough life. Discover about the people as you do favors in exchange to find the &quot;Gemstones&quot;.<br><br><strong>Gemstones</strong>, experiments who developed psychic powers. Defeat them and learn about yourself.",
